# three.js is a real dependency here and is installed, not vendored: this half
# of the repo is governed by `npm ci` against package-lock.json, which pins the
# exact bytes. The vendored-and-committed policy belongs to the Python sidecar
# (dashboard/vendor, field/vendor) and to check_vendor.sh, which does not look
# in here. package-lock.json IS committed — it is the pin.
node_modules/
dist/
*.tsbuildinfo
